        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Presence of unilateral maxillary sinus atelectasis on imaging combined with progressive enophthalmos and hypoglobus without trauma",
    "notes": "Diagnosis is primarily radiologic and clinical; biopsy or laboratory tests are not typically required."
